# Take A once more: the owner's one turn, then three taps. `next` presses the first stepper's next chevron (a stepper on stage is walked one step a tap); when there is
# no stepper, or it has no step left, the other words are tried in order: a row pick's value, or a menu's option. Each tap is skipped when none of them is on stage.
hold 3
vlookup: type | Create an interactive explanation of how VLOOKUP works using the canvas
rest
hold 3
step1: tap? | next / 102 / 103 / Banana
hold 3
step2: tap? | next / 103 / 104 / Cherry / Plum
hold 3
step3: tap? | next / 104 / 101 / Kiwi / Date
hold 3
